  id: SeaSaltPans
  displayName: Salt Pans
  description: 'Shallow pans of brine drying in the sun, white salt raked into heaps.
    Salt preserves the catch: fishing and whaling bring 6% more food per pan (up
    to 3 pans), and the pans make a little food of their own. Build them by open
    sea.'
